{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1300,
  "batch_count": 1685,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "0989d82817d54956bb7882d07a074b40f2e7e565",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d889c5882c215ada6ab89cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了让大家都感受到buono精神！\r\n我会竭尽全力嘿咻嘿～咻♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "873b4d08df496cb2d5f748873753dd554230aa9291e4f8e8b72b516c7fc1e3cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79829afb4b001222e72a4679",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这样就可以更努力帮忙了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e16a1679335e2335ac554c9b056d4c6a99f0e326873d915ad05dc16c2fa6bfa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc4fea1cb62c1cf66fb17148",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是我的新菜色～！来，张开嘴～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "83a7b4830238165ea753506fec9fcfaf8834a5c99e7d4a4c6ccdecc05d3aa887",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7336e779bac0161cdd5bc8f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Fight、噢――的说～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e5ca511fdf897751c734aab69d8c4dccc930e6e7fab6e6ddae5b70ba63e8ba1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4b14f98629fb83136be67c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员！\r\n我要成为美丽、强大、帅气的——\r\n真正的“城市女孩”！",
      "source_fingerprint": "936807d3194db9b6799f449429b176bf6ac69d34b6b868c46ba591d54918f891",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9483fe7cfe3ba260f864604",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってきやンす。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a808e5f9fd6de7038fa13794f4060fb96af4ee1f644dd6f87a9299f9ae7da1ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ba94e649230a87b5098fb6b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいまです～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9166d09a46619f5075aa2db6e594128022d6b8043a5d57c907a7762949e2832",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28ff421574a446fc23af204e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为有着在老家的大家\r\n和训练员你支持着我。\r\n我一定会非常非常努力的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9450400f40ad774bcf2907e644a2dfe6272637e9c3674eda9395b6d2e04880a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c8c7f2eb237cab55f0f7fd1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员你喜欢的东西是什么呢？\r\n……那、那个\r\n只是稍微参考一下……什么……的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b152dfd49ebcc969959c0e9947558ed7ada509faaaea4e6a41d37682bfc01ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2de328197fc876f1275635a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我老家的年糕汤……是酱油味的，\r\n然后配上四角型的年糕和鲑鱼子煮成的！\r\n训练员老家那边是怎样的呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5a4d299b28b86349be354fa062917c5976ca4197e8a01055cbdf173242e7ca5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d484760b255648102e5bad16",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我用老家牧场生产的鲜奶油\r\n做了些生巧哦。\r\n只要用上这种鲜奶油做就会很好吃呢～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd98e157ee4ef19324e8b86e67c5996d977f78f01878dd0a6bebaebb5664444c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ab8c2311fde24747f66631b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚刚给你的巧克力\r\n虽然不是什么漂亮玩意……但也是我非常努力做出来的\r\n所以等下就让我听听你的评价吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba8166cf9614a115f5edd9feca16f6f51db92b4ce23bf5210803c3e7c3b93df7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb6a46c280048c542f832a19",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "七夕节里装饰的短冊，五彩斑斓地很“上镜”呢！\r\n我也要像“城市女孩”一样，寄（自）拍一张了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5712f64cbcd1602d2715209c9b63436b77b7b81350776dabab2e754e951d0fd6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0aed8f3892eaa2b2b968e70d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "万圣节要打扮成什么样才好呢？\r\n外国的话是打扮成妖怪的样子吧？\r\n那座敷童子会好些吗……还是说河童呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "953deba9efff8e4fa776a978e149a3e063e80025d35838ef5e34c23d9bc74694",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87adc397b0f7491509877a9b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "之前我有和老家俱乐部的朋友们一起\r\n和附近福利院里的小孩子们\r\n开过圣诞会呢。那时真开心啊~！",
      "source_fingerprint": "20df62539f16491b4883971db645a50ac6df2ed816cba1bf751f766b26a3fc58",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8a5b2a2b467176f6a39038c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "街上的彩灯真漂亮呀！\r\n不过作为城里人的你又觉得\r\n怎么样呢……？请和我说说看吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "18b6118a0c5553186afafa1469e7f2f43c0461b919b3a580f1ae2fd31e52bacb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44b4a2ce53fc8c7607161fae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "做到啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "200fc70b8c71ecde45b8974d115c880ad70afdd85f022eed3da2540788ebedd2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5279488e207d6c40013309bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "家里人说着“过年的时候吃吧”，\r\n给我寄了一些生荞麦面来呢。\r\n要做些碗子荞麦面吃嘛？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d068882c7263f25947e66087a049463c4e0795d2453cc4be733f169fb25610e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aeac9aad0357ba9e4347b839",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Happy Birthday～tsu～……♪\r\ntsu……♪to～you～～♪\r\n恭、恭喜了～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e06d6a38bd387992cf8883c11129fe11c005e4fe455e041567bd0c8ad41ea2a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10a13a089efd31160d5bd518",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我纠结了很久到底送你什么生日礼物才好……\r\n所以就为你准备了一场盛冈的小旅行！\r\n怎、怎么样？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1ede0b90891a34bce7f8821c57058a4283d5846d875cdf2879fbe924b77b14c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03716334caa70fe2db66de43",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "老家的大家给我寄来了好多\r\n用来庆祝生日的好吃的！\r\n可以的话要一起吃点吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d21117425c2873a655ba2d52e5078edfab9e1850aaeec37d3a18815756c76809",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:259ba9e47e8cf7a4903b2ebb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你的祝福！\r\n那个，一会儿能一起拍一张纪念照吗？\r\n想发在Umasta上，也想给老家的各位看看……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "be3ce8dd2a508dfd7cc2b2bda9ebba8914310e3f957c46578da8ce52c39c8b4b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5aae7cc21bc7a33ddf7bcd5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊呀，好像收到了通知呢。\r\n可要好好地确认最新情报，\r\n赶上流行哦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "56ff00416d56dda47fc09667fcd62df7eac04b101ebfb1ac46940aecfb5865fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f3463d978ae215bd53abcb3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有什么包裹送到了呢！\r\n老家寄来的慰问品……不对，\r\n应该是礼物呢～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed92142efd888b725424e070fa59508c51702847d5a5f533d342f4587961471a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f854b17a759ca7c2ae10348",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇啊～，任务完成了呢！\r\n恭喜了～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "353cbb35a991a994de6b70f4e667f1fab978dbc3825fab21d95861264a5f9bcc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fad7056c22750f69c6268ddd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动很快就要开始了呢～。\r\n城里的活动……！\r\n要、要准备些什么才好……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7dc5f7a51a49684c7fe5815d1a46afc068cb67cb22c14933f8b5e6e4c36a25e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5a4fd732916fc0e73d21aa0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要参加活动了哟！\r\n这让我想起了村里的祭典呢……\r\n大家一起把气氛炒热吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a4a48fa3213317ad732d1e060c690e5367d2875c3d27a1eee38ebaece4e9ccf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1818d388e0c18969d3ee3468",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "非、非常抱歉……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0abb6c8f3767d7fa31534de65ae6fc6ee5f70d94bc2fbf856d67484018d1aa29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c02f139e62291a381c3c20c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘名鉴的等级提升了哟？！\r\n啊呀～真厉害啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "22e5d14b0e803ce9179abba99aa4cf7ef7aa99ffd05ee1fe6e61864b092e6a5f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:439fa989b7e044492774455f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "このほっこりニット、一目惚れで！\r\nピンクだし、ボタンもでっかくて、\r\nすンげぇ留めやすいンですよ～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "60d6a500bfbee2241a695766afbb03ed60e3815440227ee3ed9fdfd8e5bdda3d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f09533b7fbca9a2a5381f78",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上京ン時に持ってけなかった服も、\r\nあとで送ってもらったンですけど…\r\n実家の匂いがして、その…へへ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2dcc0692fdfc2eefa27444e9e450519a524aad85538bf1b07763dd49401e1f96",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca7f3955b930c7b4c61e7075",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "シチーさんに選ンでもらった服…\r\nもったいなくて、飾ったまンまで！\r\n勇気、出すンで…見てほしいですっ",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bac568f69fe92e644afb419fdec0dcf6581d50f60883fdcfb775dfc1054e06a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2576ca38e6d1d67314e7a55d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "实力相当呢～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa2736f6a41e8f1ca41c1e31dc8d0bd01cee6dc0b3a3012d62aebae1a2f33473",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c29c0835cfae357d9d789bf8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是我们赢了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5093d6b9799360d9c393224449f49ede416baa40bc10d31cae1ed1f399809cf6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35a2191ea5089206280de37d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "非、非常抱歉……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0abb6c8f3767d7fa31534de65ae6fc6ee5f70d94bc2fbf856d67484018d1aa29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26659d17004c77c2a6f7dcbd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "实力相当呢～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa2736f6a41e8f1ca41c1e31dc8d0bd01cee6dc0b3a3012d62aebae1a2f33473",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a4beaca150885e5c70ee427",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇啊！最高分刷新了啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "56a8929201185f713784396547c52a2a8fd7c3ffba3fcde0de405c0169934dc1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8ab72438ab8b2e1e3c5b6a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家，一起上吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "964aa8a5f85779fee82ac72fdc07e559295b2e293ca2b24f812e4fad0c408055",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:668035e978a3ff5b809cc360",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "按着自己的步调来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "54385d87ea0d09ad5281ce0276b17a8d21969da4373aa8045c45cbb605a2ed04",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "1058"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:684894b6bb75d521467874ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要上了！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8565adcbb7df5fd291d695f0d01458e53d98de213bb55dc9c4ae1d8edae3e77b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "1063"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a6d7e4340a752d967b7daf4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Fight～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2344363476fe9945fb8ef7fb7e51c7ed3bbf3903dcfe6cf930a8fc5337f87571",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "1064"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:008f73a06ee24fcb05dcf7cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "加油呗～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9eecf410c8c88d4da2b3edcb359ad4e5047be29c888bf192ef137f32aada00a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "1075"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abc97beb3cc9399a6f0053b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "非、非常感谢的说！",
      "source_fingerprint": "89093a58ac83e148e118120463aca8625434e2967f9a0623be6fa385b2e50ab2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "1085"
      ]
    },
    {
