    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6210e785a0ab61000de7a971",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么会！",
      "source_fingerprint": "28a6cbc3dbb12c098c30355bb7c6e811e7efa371a964aa64771c972a5f15a308",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9bfc7ca335bdac003e2897f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天的话好像能拿到这个呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fca87ea86bce7673ef72a7448b4f47e5d80dda086513b995424b49dce6138284",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29a6ca0fc52a46dfef1b4a9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好累……累蒙圈了……\r\n抱歉，我可能已经到极限了～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6451cc2fcdb37a1b22d649bbb89c1e41477e0bde57b6c7daafaa7708ffecc45f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38f99f27bbcbb76a47583db5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能稍微休息一下吗？\r\n休息的份我会努力补上的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6df37833f43e64296cc7c4ce79a5f6c3573bd5ae5820fb995b7dd2c26562ebbc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0dc33229f0e973ecd5f6cfe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "精神满满！精力充沛～！！\r\n训练员，不管什么训练都放马过来吧！\r\n我会以雪国的毅力，好好完成的～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5dfc12f2e3b7f244626a5dfa46f250ef6406ee1a98e14227e57e0e2b55520e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efc32a07bf2b34810d8851d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不论是火中水中还是雪中！\r\n如果是现在的话哪里都能\r\n跑下去哦～！！哼、哼！哼哼！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6085284751d8cd21400d7868b045f9311089cd487aa3683b2423d11ac8f9b05b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37d36ab79a7b2926c7758b5d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，今天也要以“城市女孩”为目标，\r\n好好地加油训练了哦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e2d8b6139fd9f7ebcaec14c5b2821d669b3083d0b18e6937535aec7ef29417e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cb1ae4dda7c99a97a4e804e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "盐分的补充已经靠老家寄来的腌菜完成了！\r\n吃起来咸咸辣辣的，\r\n只要吃了这个就会感觉很清爽呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aeebf7437cd838f5d7744a8471ff9575454c3dbe6feac61ab56e5236c323b10c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74ab2c1ab5076f89c183e7d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不输给雨，不输给风。\r\n但也不能勉强自己。靠这结实的\r\n身体，今天也一起努力加油吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4a476b7e04b656ef1beb3cc653ecf86477651123a413e63919829b898afbaaa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94c5c48bbbcb6d91e38f2803",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想提升下心情啊～\r\n……啊！能一边听着些爽朗的歌\r\n一边跑步吗？就像广告一样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "07d2631db13970dabbee098c67621c7417a94ca01210f63dfa8fee3a8039e96f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c9ad514fdc430538033fc62",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈欠，诶呀……好困……不好意思……\r\n这样是……不行的吧……嗯……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca722ce62529c2704f101aa82254346aa6018fe82ce89c102dc32829710a11f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
